learning (ML) and high-throughput calculations to uncover new ternary electrides in the A\u2082BC\u2082 family of compounds with the P4/mbm space group. Starting from a library of 214 known A\u2082BC\u2082 phases, density-functional theory calculations were used to compute the maximum value of the electron localization function, indicating that 42 are potential electrides. A model was then trained on this dataset and used to predict the electride behaviour of 14,437 hypothetical compounds generated by structural prototyping. Then, the stability and electride features of the 1254 electride candidates predicted by the model were carefully checked by high-throughput calculations."}, "custom_fields": {"mc_references": [{"ref_resource_type": "publication-article", "ref_citation": "Z. Wang et al., J. Amer. Chem. Soc. (2023)", "ref_link": {"ref_scheme": "doi", "ref_identifier": "10.1021/jacs.3c10538"}}]}, "access": {"record": "public", "files": "public", "embargo": {"active": false, "reason": null}, "status": "open"}, "files": {"enabled": true, "order": [], "count": 8, "total_bytes": 344209566, "entries": {"data.csv": {"id": "6f5af98a-6446-46c3-ac38-f2ae21fc2c53", "checksum": "md5:f55f59f16bd2be446d7c54e433f725e5", "ext": "csv", "size": 18955, "mimetype": "text/csv", "storage_class": "L", "key": "data.csv", "metadata": {}, "access": {"hidden": false}, "links": {"self": "https://archive.materialscloud.org/api/records/z24e6-dv880/files/data.csv", "content": "https://archive.materialscloud.org/api/records/z24e6-dv880/files/data.csv/content"}}, "files_description.md": {"id": "b7b88697-474b-4c1c-afd3-4b9dcb40dc59", "checksum": "md5:14b1e84b4e6ed7f472b8f8914db0375c", "ext": "md", "size": 1161, "mimetype": "application/octet-stream", "storage_class": "L", "key": "files_description.md", "metadata": {}, "access": {"hidden": false}, "links": {"self": "https://archive.materialscloud.org/api/records/z24e6-dv880/files/files_description.md", "content": "https://archive.materialscloud.or